<title>BELGIUM: CREYF'S TO PUBLISH 1996 RESULTS MARCH 13.</title>
<headline>CREYF'S TO PUBLISH 1996 RESULTS MARCH 13.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian employment services company Creyf's Interim NV will release 1996 results on March 13, the company said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
